---
import SiteLayout from '../../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
import { APP_STORE_URL, SUPPORT_EMAIL, pathFor } from '../../config/site';
---
<SiteLayout title="Website privacy" description="How the Golden Moments website handles privacy: no accounts, cookies, analytics, forms, or photo uploads.">
  <section class="interior-hero">
    <div class="reading-column">
      <p class="eyebrow">Plain and simple</p>
      <h1>Website privacy</h1>
      <p class="interior-lede">This website is built to be read, not to collect information about you.</p>
      <p class="small-print">Last updated October 18, 2026</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <div class="reading-column prose-page">
    <h2>What this website does</h2>
    <p>Golden Moments' website is a static website hosted on GitHub Pages. We do not operate a website account service, mailing-list form, advertising pixels, or analytics scripts. We do not set cookies or use browser storage to track visits.</p>
    <p>The little matching activity runs in your browser using built-in illustrations. It does not request access to your device's photos, and no pictures are uploaded.</p>

    <h2>Hosting and outside websites</h2>
    <p>GitHub Pages serves the website, so GitHub may process technical request information as part of hosting. Visit <a href="https://docs.github.com/en/site-policy/privacy-policies/github-general-privacy-statement" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub's privacy statement</a> for its practices.</p>
    <p>Following the App Store, caregiving resource, or email links takes you to another service governed by its own privacy practices. This website does not control those services.</p>

    <h2>About the Golden Moments app</h2>
    <p>This page describes the <strong>website</strong>, not every version of the mobile app. Read the <a href={pathFor('/app-privacy/')}>Golden Moments mobile app privacy policy</a> and <a href={pathFor('/privacy-choices/')}>privacy choices guide</a>. The <a href={APP_STORE_URL} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">live App Store page</a> describes the currently published version, which may differ from a future update.</p>
    <p>Selected-family-photo activities are under development for a future app update, and are not available in the currently published App Store version. The website itself does not offer photo syncing or uploading.</p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>For privacy questions, contact the developer at <a href={'mailto:' + SUPPORT_EMAIL}>{SUPPORT_EMAIL}</a>. Please do not email private family photos or medical information unless necessary to explain an issue.</p>

    <p class="back-home"><a class="text-link" href={pathFor('/legal/')}>← Legal information</a></p>
  </div>
</SiteLayout>
